# ── Excluded imagery ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~156 MB of AI-generated composites that PRODUCT.md rules out of use, held
# in two byte-identical copies. Nothing in src/ references them.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Written as "images/" this matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# public/images/ and dist/images/ — every picture the site actually serves.
/images/
/legacy-html/unused-media/

# Generated analysis output. Deliberately unanchored: there is a copy under
# src/ as well, and both are regenerated.
graphify-out/

